# Reproducible Project Foundation

Status: IN_PROGRESS
Milestone: M2 Core utility
Dependencies: 03_CAPTURE_PROOF.todo

## Purpose

Create a small reproducible Windows application structure from the proven spike.

## Tasks

- [x] Pin .NET10.0.112 SDK, Windows WPF target and native x64 preview path.
- [x] Create App/Core/xUnit tests plus synthetic audio and shared-adapter capture proof projects.
- [x] Choose xUnit for Core, typed P/Invoke and locked NuGet dependencies; audio harness uses existing .NET.
- [x] Configure normal-user execution, STA startup, DPI awareness, explicit window creation, and shutdown.
- [x] Extend ignore rules for build output, local notes, captures, credentials, recovery and private context.
- [x] Document actual restore/build/test commands and preview publish script.
- [ ] Add CI for deterministic build/unit tests without claiming hosted CI validates interactive capture.
- [ ] Record license/dependency notices after owner approval; enable remote workflow only when authorized.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] A clean supported development machine reproduces restore, build, and core tests.
- [ ] No auto-shown startup window bypasses CapturePolicy.
- [ ] Public source/docs stand alone without private machine paths or sibling projects.
- [ ] No unused runtime service, browser renderer, telemetry, or elevation requirement is introduced.

## Completion evidence

- PhantomFudge.slnx, global.json, Directory.Build.props, locked project restores and real local builds.
- CI/clean-machine/release license gates remain open; no remote workflow was enabled.

